      <h2>One service account, Frymaster + Garland + Manitowoc + Beverage-Air + Lincoln + more</h2>
      <p>The Ali Group acquisition of Welbilt put Frymaster into the same parent foodservice portfolio as a long list of LA-relevant commercial brands. For operators running multi-Ali kitchens, that opens up a single-call operational pattern that wasn't available pre-2022. (Note: Pitco — the other major commercial fryer brand — is NOT on this list. Pitco is part of Middleby Corporation via the Blodgett 1981 acquisition chain. See the cross-corporate competitor section below for the Pitco vs Frymaster framing.)</p>
      <p>Our Ali Group sibling coverage spans:</p>
