        <li><strong><a href="/brands/scotsman/" class="brand-inline-link">Scotsman ice machines</a></strong> — Ali Group ice sibling alongside Manitowoc and Ice-O-Matic and Kold-Draft (post-Welbilt acquisition combined Ali ice family).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For multi-Ali LA kitchens (extremely common in hotel banquet operations, hotel chain builds, dealer-spec turnkey installations, and QSR/casual dining standardized on the Ali equipment package), single SDAR account covers the full sibling list. One Friday afternoon call can dispatch service across the Frymaster fryer line, the Beverage-Air bar refrigeration, and the Champion dishwasher in the back dish station, three brands and three categories on one service relationship.</p>
